@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Times New Roman"
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam ArrowColor #34495E
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.5
skinparam nodesep 55
skinparam ranksep 65
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #34495E
  FontColor #172A3A
}
skinparam legend {
  BackgroundColor white
  BorderColor white
  FontSize 16
}
rectangle "Node awal\nA" as A #FFF2CC
rectangle "Node B" as B #D9EAF7
rectangle "Node C" as C #D9EAF7
rectangle "Posisi agen\nD" as D #E2F0D9
A -right[#2E75B6]-> B : ruas 1
B -down[#2E75B6]-> C : ruas 2
C -left[#2E75B6]-> D : ruas 3
A .down[#666666]. D : jarak langsung\nHaversine
legend bottom
Garis utuh: perjalanan A → B → C → D.
Garis putus-putus: jarak langsung A–D, bukan ruas yang dapat dipilih.
Ilustrasi konsep; posisi tidak menggambarkan koordinat sebenarnya.
endlegend
@enduml
